  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pr&#xe9;vention et r&#xe9;ponse multisectorielle d&apos;urgence aux besoins des survivant-e-s de VBG, et protection contre l&#x2019;exploitation et les abus sexuels dans les provinces du Nord-Kivu et du Sud-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide emergency GBV protection assistance to displaced, vulnerable people. This UNFPA project life-saving assistance to GBV- survivors by providing multi-sectoral services and by strengthening GBV risk prevention in displacement areas in North and South Kivu. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 10,061 people, including 5,700 women, 3,728 children, and including 704 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
